{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 55, :comments ["<b>בקרחתו או בגבחתו.</b> It refers to the garment as well — for a person also calls the place of hair 'קרח' and the place without hair 'גבח.' So too it says for leather and for garment: in the place of hair — בקרחתו, and not in the place of hair — בגבחתו."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:02.130257148Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}